#: ../../source/reference/compatibility.md:1
msgid "Compatibility reference"
msgstr "兼容性参考"

#: ../../source/reference/compatibility.md:3
msgid ""
"Compatibility depends on source checkpoint format, recognized model "
"structure, quantization policy, output ABI, backend availability, and "
"runtime loader support. A model name alone does not establish "
"compatibility."
msgstr "兼容性取决于源检查点格式、已识别的模型结构、量化策略、输出 ABI、后端可用性以及运行时加载器支持。仅凭模型名称不能确定兼容性。"

#: ../../source/reference/compatibility.md:5
msgid "Source checkpoint compatibility"
msgstr "源检查点兼容性"

#: ../../source/reference/compatibility.md:7
msgid ""
"The loader supports safetensors checkpoints in either single-file or "
"indexed-sharded form. It does not accept arbitrary low-precision layouts "
"or PyTorch `.bin` files. BF16, FP16, and FP32 weights can be selected "
"directly. Recognized MXFP4 E2M1 with E8M0 scales and strict 128 × 128 "
"block FP8 with E8M0 scales can be converted to BF16 or processed through "
"the recognized path. Unknown low-precision layouts are refused. The "
"documented validation workflow emphasizes indexed sharded checkpoints; "
"verify single-file behavior in the target code and runtime environment "
"before relying on it for a release workflow."
msgstr "The loader 支持 safetensors 检查点 in either single-file or 带索引的-分片的 形式。 It does not accept arbitrary low-precision 布局 or PyTorch `.bin` files。 BF16， FP16， and FP32 权重 can be 选中的 directly。 已识别的 MXFP4 E2M1 with E8M0 scales and strict 128 × 128 块 FP8 with E8M0 scales can be converted to BF16 or processed through the 已识别的 路径。 Unknown low-precision 布局 are 拒绝。 The documented 验证 工作流 emphasizes 带索引的 分片的 检查点； verify single-file behavior in the 目标 代码 and 运行时 环境 before relying on it for a release 工作流。"

#: ../../source/reference/compatibility.md:9
msgid ""
"Do not use a generated compressed-tensors artifact as the recommended "
"source for another quantization run. Start from the original checkpoint "
"and apply one quantization policy. Keep input and output directories "
"separate."
msgstr "Do not use a generated compressed-tensors 产物 as the recommended 源 for another 量化 运行。 Start from the 原始 检查点 and apply one 量化 策略。 Keep 输入 and 输出 目录 单独。"

