#: ../../source/reference/compatibility.md:53
msgid ""
"CUDA normally resolves the default device to `cuda:0`. Other registered "
"backend names normally resolve to `<backend>:0` unless `--device` "
"supplies an explicit identifier. For PPU, DCU, or another vendor "
"extension, use the actual backend name registered with PyTorch rather "
"than guessing from the vendor name."
msgstr "CUDA normally resolves the 默认 设备 to `cuda：0`。 Other 注册的 后端 名称 normally resolve to `<backend>：0` unless `--device` supplies an 显式 标识符。 For PPU， DCU， or another vendor extension， use the actual 后端 name 注册的 with PyTorch rather than guessing from the vendor name。"

#: ../../source/reference/compatibility.md:55
msgid ""
"Conversion and non-calibrated MSE quantization may warn and perform "
"operation-level CPU fallback when the requested accelerator is "
"unavailable. Calibrated GPTQ, AWQ, and AutoRound execution requires an "
"available backend and fails rather than silently falling back. Any "
"fallback is functional evidence only, not evidence of target-device "
"performance."
msgstr "转换 and non-calibrated MSE 量化 may warn and perform operation-level CPU 回退 when the requested accelerator is unavailable。 Calibrated GPTQ， AWQ， and AutoRound execution 需要 an available 后端 and fails rather than silently falling back。 Any 回退 is 功能 证据 仅， not 证据 of 目标-设备 性能。"

