#: ../../source/reference/compatibility.md:62
msgid "loading the declared compressed-tensors, GPTQ, AWQ, or AutoRound ABI"
msgstr "加载 the declared compressed-tensors， GPTQ， AWQ， or AutoRound ABI"

#: ../../source/reference/compatibility.md:63
msgid "executing the required Linear or MoE kernel path, or a verified fallback"
msgstr "executing the 必需 Linear or MoE kernel 路径， or a verified 回退"

#: ../../source/reference/compatibility.md:64
msgid "mapping the exact model architecture and layer names"
msgstr "mapping the exact model architecture and layer 名称"

#: ../../source/reference/compatibility.md:65
msgid ""
"fitting tensor parallelism, KV cache, workspace, communication buffers, "
"graph capture, and framework overhead into available memory"
msgstr "fitting tensor parallelism， KV cache， 工作区， communication 缓冲区， graph capture， and 框架 开销 into available 内存"

#: ../../source/reference/compatibility.md:67
msgid ""
"`compressed-tensors` describes and stores quantized weights. It does not "
"provide a kernel for every framework, model, or accelerator. vLLM can "
"support compressed-tensors for particular combinations, but the exact "
"vLLM version, model, hardware, and kernel path must be tested."
msgstr "`compressed-tensors` describes and 存储 quantized 权重。 It does not provide a kernel for every 框架， model， or accelerator。 vLLM can support compressed-tensors for particular combinations， but the exact vLLM version， model， 硬件， and kernel 路径 必须 be tested。"

#: ../../source/reference/compatibility.md:69
msgid "Portability and evidence boundaries"
msgstr "可移植性和证据边界"

#: ../../source/reference/compatibility.md:71
msgid ""
"Generated artifacts can be copied between platforms, but each target "
"platform needs independent loading, accuracy, memory, and performance "
"validation. `validate` proves structural and metadata consistency only. "
"It does not prove inference loading, accuracy, memory capacity, "
"throughput, production readiness, or kernel availability. CUDA generation"
" success and CPU fallback do not establish deployment support on NVIDIA, "
"PPU, DCU, or another accelerator."
msgstr "Generated artifacts can be copied between platforms， but each 目标 platform needs independent 加载， 精度， 内存， and 性能 验证。 `validate` proves structural and 元数据 consistency 仅。 It does not prove 推理 加载， 精度， 内存 capacity， 吞吐量， production readiness， or kernel availability。 CUDA generation success and CPU 回退 do not establish deployment support on NVIDIA， PPU， DCU， or another accelerator。"

